  "id": "ecosystemic-approach",
  "term": "ecosystemic approach",
  "definition": "An ecosystemic approach is a way of addressing a problem by involving all responsible parties rather than focusing on just one individual. In this context, it means interventions for bullying should take account of the subtype involved and include the wider people and systems connected to the situation.",
